desc: Just a Phase (Classic Phaser RE-01 port) by chmaha
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Stereo phaser with a vintage flavour: 4 to 12 allpass stages, upper sweep limit, LFO rate with optional host
  tempo sync, depth, stereo spread, feedback, mix and level, plus 15 factory presets. Classic Phaser RE-01 is
  AnClark Liu's reverse-engineered recreation of a much-loved free studio phaser from the early 2000s, rebuilt
  statement by statement from the original binary; this port matches it exactly.
  Ported from Classic Phaser RE-01 by AnClark Liu (GPL-3.0-or-later) https://github.com/AnClark/ClassicPhaser-RE01
  Title lettering drawn from the outlines of Orbitron by Matt McInerney (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0-or-later
  Claude generated some of this code
// Copyright (C) 2026 AnClark Liu <clarklaw4701@qq.com>
// Copyright (C) 2026 chmaha (JSFX port)
//
